.codebuddy/

# Secrets / credentials — 切勿提交（含真实学习通会话，误提交即永久泄露）
cookies.json
services/perception/cx_crawler/cookies.json
services/perception/cx_crawler/courses.json
services/perception/cx_crawler/bridge_config.json
.env
.env.*
